  <History Date="31-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed normal mode reset macro.  Increased wheel resolution.  Revised CTO." />
  <History Date="31-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised P/T Speed DMX range.  Simplified and standarised colour macro." />
  <History Date="31-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Swapped yellow and warm yellow." />
